["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/doesNotAffect", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Vulnerability has no impact on each `to` Element. The use of the `doesNotAffect` is constrained to `VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship` classed relationships.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
